  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Boogieman Sam** (1 other source): Features a double time boogie intro and includes other double time boogie sections [1]\n- **Gilgamesh** (1 other source): Incorporates bits of Dragon and concludes with a reprise of Swan Song [1]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Swan Song**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 14 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **kglw2024-08-30.mysteryjackofficial** (recommended): audience recording; 16 songs; 128 min [1]\n- **KGTLW2024-08-30.flac.24**: source not stated; 16 songs; 127 min [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **kglw2024-08-30.mysteryjackofficial**: taped by @mysteryjackofficial; transferred by @mysteryjackofficial; source: Source: AUD- Church Audio CA14 microphones> Sound Professionals 9v battery box> Roland R-07 digital recorder [1]\n- **KGTLW2024-08-30.flac.24**: taped by George Hodges, Jr.; transferred by George Hodges, Jr. [2]. Also: Recorded by George Hodges, Jr. using Microtech Gefell M-21 mics and Sony A-10 recorder; Transferred via Izotope and Wavelab, then processed for declicking and spectral repair [2]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by panetory.com: [King Gizzard And The Lizard Wizard Harrah's Cherokee Center Asheville NC Aug 30 2024 Poster 2026](https://panetory.com/king-gizzard-and-the-lizard-wizard-harrahs-cherokee-center-asheville-nc-aug-30-2024-poster) [4]\n- Fan art by panetory.com: [King Gizzard And The Lizard Wizard Harrah's Cherokee Center Asheville NC Aug 30 2024 Poster 2026](https://panetory.com/king-gizzard-and-the-lizard-wizard-harrahs-cherokee-center-asheville-nc-aug-30-2024-poster) [5]\n- Poster by HCCA: [King Gizzard and the Lizard Wizard | Harrah's Cherokee Center - Asheville](https://www.harrahscherokeecenterasheville.com/events/2024-king-gizzard-and-the-lizard-wizard/) [6]\n- Fan art by Jason Galea Photos: [Live in Asheville '24, by King Gizzard & the Lizard Wizard / Releases / KGLW.net](https://kglw.net/discography/live-in-asheville-24) [7]",
